WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:05.579
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do: Administer spankings to Dr. Rights.

00:00:05.579 --> 00:00:10.750
If Dr. Rights is found to be in violation
of any Foundation rules or regulations, there

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:14.950
are existing disciplinary actions in place
that should be abided by.

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:19.220
Dr. Bright is to be reminded that corporal
punishment is not considered an acceptable

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:23.529
method of discipline in a professional environment,
or anywhere else.

00:00:23.529 --> 00:00:27.800
It doesn't matter if "His parents spanked
him and he turned out fine," he did not turn

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.999
out fine, and he is not Dr. Rights' parent.

00:00:30.999 --> 00:00:35.610
The HR department is tired of dealing with
this, and if it is not handled, Laura from

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:41.020
that department has said, quote, "I'll throw
him out my office window, and I'm not joking."

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.190
She's not joking.

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:43.030
Cut it out.

